  ('Cerave Baby Wash & Shampoo', 'cerave-baby-wash-shampoo', 'DescriptionCeraVe Baby Wash & ShampooDeveloped with dermatologists, CeraVe Baby Wash & Shampoo is a gentle 2-in-1 formula designed to cleanse and nourish your baby’s delicate skin and hair. Infused with three essential ceramides and vitamins, this tear-free formula helps maintain the skin’s natural barrier while providing a soothing bath experience. Ideal for infants and toddlers, it is dermatolog', 2400, NULL, ARRAY['https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0799/3062/2197/files/1000023074.jpg?v=1784364885','https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0799/3062/2197/files/1001414369.jpg?v=1791871501','https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0799/3062/2197/files/1001414370.jpg?v=1791871516']::text[], 'cleansers', 'CERAVE', ARRAY['All'], ARRAY[]::text[], TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, 4.0, 1),
