  ('Axis-Y Artichoke Intensive Skin Barrier Ampoule.', 'axis-y-artichoke-intensive-skin-barrier-ampoule', 'DescriptionAxis-Y Artichoke Intensive Skin Barrier Ampoule.This is enriched with artichoke leaf extract and it’s amazing for repairing the skin’s barrier.It’s a lightweight, fast-absorbing formula that penetrates deep, delivering a surge of moisture and nutrients that quench your skin’s thirst.With consistent use, you’ll notice a reduction in redness, irritation, and uneven texture, revealing a sm', 2600, 2100, ARRAY['https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0799/3062/2197/files/1000090012.jpg?v=1784364915']::text[], 'serums', 'AXIS-Y', ARRAY['All'], ARRAY[]::text[], TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 4.6, 12),
