  ('Axis Y Mini Glow Set', 'axis-y-mini-glow-set', 'DescriptionA giftable set with four skincare minis. Experience our four-step collection for glowing skin with our community favorite minis: Quini, Puri, Arti, and Glowi*.*Quini – Easily cleans skin without causing any irritations *Puri – Clears and treats deep in pores *Glowi – Enhance skin’s glow by naturally reducing discoloration', 2500, 4100, ARRAY['https://images.pexels.com/photos/8140912/pexels-photo-8140912.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=800']::text[], 'bodycare', 'AXIS-Y', ARRAY['All'], ARRAY[]::text[], TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, 4.1, 15),
  ('Naturium UV Reflect Antioxidant SPF 50', 'naturium-uv-reflect-antioxidant-spf-50', 'DescriptionNaturium UV Reflect Antioxidant SPF 50Introducing the Naturium UV Reflect Antioxidant SPF 50, a cutting-edge sheer sunscreen designed to offer comprehensive protection against harmful UVA and UVB rays. With a high SPF 50 PA++++ rating, this lightweight fluid formula is perfect for daily wear, ensuring your skin stays safeguarded without feeling heavy or greasy.Infused with 2% InfraGuard', 5000, 2000, ARRAY['https://images.pexels.com/photos/16378485/pexels-photo-16378485.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=800']::text[], 'sunscreen', 'NATURIUM', ARRAY['All'], ARRAY[]::text[], TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, 4.9, 23),
  ('Rovectin Calming Lotus Toner 200ml', 'rovectin-calming-lotus-toner-200ml', 'DescriptionThe Rovectin Calming Lotus Water Toner is a soothing and nourishing toner designed to pamper your skin.The Calming Lotus Water Toner aims to soothe and purify sensitive, irritated skin.This toner has a lightweight texture that quickly absorbs quickly into the skin without stickiness.Ingredients: Contains 40% Lotus Water and Lotus Flower Extract. Maintains desired hydration through 7seve', 2500, 3400, ARRAY['https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0799/3062/2197/files/1000163589.jpg?v=1784364553']::text[], 'toners', 'ROVECTIN', ARRAY['All'], ARRAY[]::text[], TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, 3.9, 26),
  ('Naturium BHA Liquid Exfoliant 2%', 'naturium-bha-liquid-exfoliant-2', 'DescriptionA leave-on exfoliant is formulated with an efficacious level of encapsulated salicylic acid and bioactive fruit acids that unclog pores, even skin tone, and smooth fine lines and wrinkles for a healthier, more radiant-looking complexion', 4400, 2900, ARRAY['https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0799/3062/2197/files/1000283579.jpg?v=1784364642']::text[], 'serums', 'NATURIUM', ARRAY['All'], ARRAY['Acne'], TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 3.9, 56),
  ('SOME BY MI – SUPER MATCH PORE CLEAN CLAY MASK 100g', 'some-by-mi-super-match-pore-clean-clay-mask-100g', 'DescriptionThis product is Enriched with calming botanical ingredients such as centella extract, tea tree leaf water, glacial water, BHA and 102,000ppm Super Matcha, this clay mask thoroughly cleanses pores and hydrates skin while ridding it of excess sebum and impurities.This solves all your pore concerns such as Blackheads, whiteheads, sebum, enlarged pores. etc.& troubles all in one simple go.', 2500, 1700, ARRAY['https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0799/3062/2197/files/1000283670.jpg?v=1784364517']::text[], 'serums', 'SOME BY MI', ARRAY['All'], ARRAY[]::text[], TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 4.2, 18),
  ('GOOD MOLECULES Instant Cleansing Balm 75g', 'good-molecules-instant-cleansing-balm-75g', 'DescriptionGOOD MOLECULES Instant Cleansing Balm 75gGood Molecules Instant Cleansing Balm is your go-to solution for a deep, effective cleanse without compromising skin comfort. This luxurious balm is enriched with nourishing ingredients like sea buckthorn oil, camellia oil, and shea butter, which work together to dissolve makeup, dirt, environmental pollutants, and other impurities upon contact w', 3200, 4150, ARRAY['https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0799/3062/2197/files/1000284381.jpg?v=1784364794']::text[], 'cleansers', 'GOOD MOLECULES', ARRAY['All'], ARRAY[]::text[], TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, 4.7, 48),
  ('Good Molecules Hyaluronic Acid Boosting Essence', 'good-molecules-hyaluronic-acid-boosting-essence', 'DescriptionGood Molecules Hyaluronic Acid Boosting Essence 120mlGood Molecules Hyaluronic Acid Boosting Essence 120ml is a deeply hydrating essence designed to enhance skin texture and retain moisture. Packed with hyaluronic acid, this essence penetrates deep into the skin to provide long-lasting hydration and improve skin elasticity. It helps refine the skin’s surface, leaving it soft, plump, and', 3300, 3200, ARRAY['https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0799/3062/2197/files/1000284384.jpg?v=1784364795','https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0799/3062/2197/files/1000284385_f083cacf-b91c-4927-a70d-558f8bc3f61d.png?v=1784364795']::text[], 'serums', 'GOOD MOLECULES', ARRAY['All'], ARRAY['Hydration'], TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 4.3, 9),
  ('La Roche-Posay Mela B3 Gel Cleanser', 'la-roche-posay-mela-b3-gel-cleanser', 'DescriptionLa Roche-Posay Mela B3 Gel CleanserLa Roche-Posay Mela B3 Gel Cleanser is a gentle yet effective facial cleanser that combines the brightening power of Vitamin B3 (Niacinamide) with soothing thermal spring water. This gel formula helps to remove dirt, oil, and impurities while promoting an even skin tone and enhancing the skin’s radiance. Perfect for sensitive skin, the cleanser gently ', 4300, 2300, ARRAY['https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0799/3062/2197/files/1000124984.jpg?v=1784364733','https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0799/3062/2197/files/1000124985.jpg?v=1784364733']::text[], 'serums', 'LA ROCHE POSAY', ARRAY['All'], ARRAY['Pore Care','Dark Spots'], TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 1.0, 1),
  ('BY WISHTREND Vitamin A-mazing Bakuchiol Retinal Night Cream', 'by-wishtrend-vitamin-a-mazing-bakuchiol-retinal-night-cream', 'DescriptionBY WISHTREND Vitamin A-mazing Bakuchiol Retinal Night CreamBY WISHTREND Vitamin A-mazing Bakuchiol Retinal Night Cream is a powerful overnight treatment designed to rejuvenate and transform your skin while you sleep. This night cream combines the gentle yet effective benefits of bakuchiol and retinal, offering a more natural alternative to traditional retinol. It works to diminish fine ', 3200, 2700, ARRAY['https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0799/3062/2197/files/1000125042.png?v=1784364894']::text[], 'serums', 'BY WISH TREND', ARRAY['All'], ARRAY['Anti-Aging'], TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 4.9, 26),
  ('Isntree Yam Root Vegan Milk Toner', 'isntree-yam-root-vegan-milk-toner', 'DescriptionIsntree Yam Root Vegan Milk TonerIsntree Yam Root Vegan Milk Toner is a moisturizing, nourishing toner that provides deep hydration to your skin while maintaining a healthy, balanced complexion. Infused with yam root extract, this toner is designed to hydrate and soothe the skin, making it an ideal addition to any skincare routine, especially for dry or sensitive skin. The toner’s vegan', 2800, 4500, ARRAY['https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0799/3062/2197/files/1000125057.jpg?v=1784364762']::text[], 'toners', 'ISNTREE', ARRAY['All'], ARRAY[]::text[], TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, 3.9, 20),
  ('COSRX The Alpha-Arbutin 2 Discoloration Care Serum', 'cosrx-the-alpha-arbutin-2-discoloration-care-serum', 'DescriptionThe COSRX The Alpha-Arbutin 2 Discoloration Care Serum is a high-potency serum with anti-melanin active ingredients like Alpha Arbutin, Tranexamic Acid, and Niacinamide, effectively addressing every stage of hyperpigmentation while soothing irritation and providing hydration.', 3200, 2100, ARRAY['https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0799/3062/2197/files/1000221043.jpg?v=1784364851']::text[], 'serums', 'COSRX', ARRAY['All'], ARRAY['Pore Care','Dark Spots'], TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 4.7, 41),
  ('Dr Althea 147 Barrier Cream', 'dr-althea-147-barrier-cream', 'DescriptionDr Althea 147 Barrier Cream is an advanced skincare product designed to enhance the skin barrier, nourish the skin, and provide deep hydration. It incorporates a patented ingredient, Paeonia Albiflora Flower Extract, along with nourishing components like avocado fruit extract, Argania spinosa kernel oil, Camellia sinensis seed oil and Tocopherol. The cream’s seven-layered hyaluronic aci', 3200, 2500, ARRAY['https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0799/3062/2197/files/49f4479570dcd157ad446dbddc6d1614.jpg?v=1793702569','https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0799/3062/2197/files/a8005028e60f12c9d4b4eab7c09eef6c.jpg?v=1793702569','https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0799/3062/2197/files/c7c475679a8f94c77df713be95de3359.jpg?v=1793702569','https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0799/3062/2197/files/fb447bfd2c4db0c660a4c8dcd1fc2346.jpg?v=1793702569']::text[], 'serums', 'Dr.Althea', ARRAY['All'], ARRAY[]::text[], TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 4.8, 25),
  ('Isntree Yam Root Vegan Milk Cream', 'isntree-yam-root-vegan-milk-cream', 'DescriptionIsntree Yam Root Vegan Milk Cream contains 57% Andong yam root extract to provide deep moisture to the skin. It is enriched with botanical phyto mucin to reinforce the skin’s protective barrier and five varieties of ceramides to safeguard and moisturize the skin. The formula is both vegan and cruelty-free, and has undergone clinical testing to ensure it does not cause skin irritation.', 2900, 3200, ARRAY['https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0799/3062/2197/files/1000283601.jpg?v=1784364762']::text[], 'serums', 'ISNTREE', ARRAY['All'], ARRAY[]::text[], TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 4.4, 47),
  ('THE ORDINARY Retinol 0.5% in Squalane', 'the-ordinary-retinol-05-in-squalane', 'DescriptionTHE ORDINARY Retinol 0.5% in Squalane is a highly stable, water-free, high strength age-defying solution features 0.5% pure retinol. This special form of vitamin A has been proven to minimise fine lines, improve pigment problems, revitalise skin and make its overall appearance fresher and more youthful.', 2600, 2000, ARRAY['https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0799/3062/2197/files/1000480023.jpg?v=1784364477']::text[], 'serums', 'THE ORDINARY', ARRAY['All'], ARRAY['Anti-Aging'], TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 3.9, 44),
  ('APLB Glutathione Niacinamide Eye Cream', 'aplb-glutathione-niacinamide-eye-cream', 'DescriptionAPLB Glutathione Niacinamide Eye Cream – Say goodbye to tired and puffy eyes with this eye cream charged with glutathione and niacinamide to firm and brighten skin while smoothing out wrinkles and fine lines. Cica extract keeps irritation at bay. The lightweight and quick-absorbent texture enables swift penetration of active ingredients deep inside skin.', 1900, 2600, ARRAY['https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0799/3062/2197/files/1000480035.jpg?v=1784364935','https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0799/3062/2197/files/1000480034.jpg?v=1784364935']::text[], 'serums', 'APLB', ARRAY['All'], ARRAY['Pore Care','Dark Spots'], TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 4.1, 20),
